The PWA icons are rendered directly from the project's built-in vector whale
in icon.svg. They contain no optional character illustrations. Maintainers can
rebuild both sizes using ops/generate-pwa-icons.mjs with Node >=22.5 and an
installed Chromium browser; no npm dependencies are required.

Bundled character artwork in pet-art/ was newly generated for Podwhale with
the built-in imagegen tool, using the project's public marketing illustration
as its visual reference. It is distinct from the optional legacy files below.
pet-art/SOURCE.md records the reference and generation prompts;
pet-art/manifest.json records the fixed image files, dimensions and SHA-256
checksums. Generation provenance is a factual record, not proof of third-party
rights clearance, and does not relicense the excluded legacy material.

